At the end of an epoch, the  is called to trigger 'epoch end without depeg event', making risk users the winners and entitling them to  (risk + hedge) from the vault.
In the case of the Arbitrum sequencer going down or restarting, there is a [grace period of one hour](https://github.com/code-423n4/2022-09-y2k-finance/blob/2175c044af98509261e4147edeb48e1036773771/src/Controller.sol#L285) before the  returns to execute without reverting. This means that the  cannot complete during this time, because it calls the .

